// Windows resource script for BubiX1turboZ, compiled by windres
// (scripts/build_nim_app.sh) and linked into the executable.
//
// Resource id 1 (CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID) - the well-known slot
// CreateProcess's manifest probing looks at - and the MANIFEST resource
// type keyword windres recognizes directly (no windows.h macro needed for
// either the id or the RT_MANIFEST=24 it stands for). See app.manifest's
// own comment for why this app cannot start without it.
1 MANIFEST "app.manifest"

// The exe's own icon (Explorer, taskbar, Alt+Tab). Same id (1) as the
// manifest above without colliding: RT_ICON/RT_GROUP_ICON (what the ICON
// keyword produces) is a different resource type from RT_MANIFEST.
// Regenerated from the same source artwork as the other platforms' icons
// by scripts/make_icon_windows.ps1 and committed, so building never needs
// that script to run - see its own comment.
1 ICON "app.ico"
